DS Last Login plugin add an extra column to the users list "Last Login"

== Description ==

DS Last Login plugin that allows you to see active users last login date and time

== Installation ==

1. Upload DS Last Login directory to the /wp-content/plugins/
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress admin

